  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1302.01 Federal Requirements Incorporated",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1302.01 Federal Requirements Incorporated. Subject to the amendments specified in Env-Hw 1302.02, the provisions for management of hazardous waste pharmaceuticals in 40 CFR 266 Subpart P shall apply in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #13407, eff 7-23-22",
